  "name": "Lantern crossing",
  "description": "A small coastal journey: find a safe route while the tide rises. For a first rehearsal, try Footing against target 6 and agree to spend 1 Supply on the attempt. Describe success and a setback before rolling. These are suggestions for an experience, never facts about a world.",
